摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"The DeepSeek Harness plugin for OpenPencil — preview, inspect, and edit real .op documents inside a conversation.","id":"gh:1332212466","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-openpencil","slug":"ZSeven-W/dsh-openpencil","topics":["deepseek-harness","design","dsh","dsh-plugin","openpencil","ppt","ui","ui-design"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"The DeepSeek Harness plugin for OpenPencil — preview, inspect, and edit real .op documents inside a "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"Harness plugin for OpenPencil — preview, inspect, and edit real .op documents inside a conversation."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH OpenPencil"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"The DeepSeek Harness plugin for OpenPencil — preview, inspect, and edit real .op documents inside a "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"Harness plugin for OpenPencil — preview, inspect, and edit real .op documents inside a conversation."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Exact Multi-Frame Previews • Interactive Canvas • Managed Editor • Agent-Native Design Tools"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"npm: @zseven-w/dsh-openpencil · Current plugin release: 0.1.0-rc.14 · Editor panel verified on DSH D"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"h-openpencil · Current plugin release: 0.1.0-rc.14 · Editor panel verified on DSH Desktop 0.2.1-rc.3"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English · 简体中文 · 繁體中文 · 日本語 · 한국어 · Français · Español · Deutsch · Português · Русский · हिन्दी · Tü"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"rkçe · ไทย · Tiếng Việt · Bahasa Indonesia"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Exact multi-frame .op previews with an interactive canvas and the managed editor workbench"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Why DSH OpenPencil"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"DSH OpenPencil connects DeepSeek Harness with OpenPencil so an Agent drives a real, editable, intera"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ctive design canvas instead of returning a generated image."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 🖼️ Exact Multi-Frame Previews"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The installed OpenPencil headless exporter renders design-faithful previews: the first top-level fra"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"me as a large replay-safe PNG, plus a horizontally scrollable thumbnail rail, click-to-select, and p"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"revious/next navigation for multi-frame documents."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 🗺️ Interactive Canvas"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"\"Open interactive canvas\" lazily mounts the read-only OpenPencil Web SDK with pan, zoom, and fit — i"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"nspect any page, nested node, or inactive page without leaving the conversation."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### ✏️ Managed Editor"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"With `editable: true`, the edit action opens the managed OpenPencil editor — selection, layers, prop"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"erties, drawing tools, undo/redo, and explicit save semantics — in a resizable right-hand workbench "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"with a full-screen option."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 🤖 Agent-Native Design Tools"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Five direct-canvas tools plus six `openpencil_pipeline_*` tools let the Agent create, inspect, refin"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"e, publish, modify, and read a real canvas through managed OpenPencil runtimes."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### 🔐 Capability-Gated Grants"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Image and document grants are signed, hash-bound capabilities. Browser metadata never exposes an arb"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"itrary host path, and signed preview/editor capabilities never enter the canonical tool result or mo"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"path, and signed preview/editor capabilities never enter the canonical tool result or model context."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### ⚡ Transactional Safety"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"A full-pipeline document stays in a private unpublished draft until every native and DSH quality gat"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"e passes. Publication never overwrites an existing path, and aborts or failed batches leave no empty"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"cation never overwrites an existing path, and aborts or failed batches leave no empty target behind."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### 🌍 Follows DSH Look & Feel"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The tool card and managed editor follow DSH's Chinese/English locale and light/dark theme without re"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"loading the editing session."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### 🎯 One Complete Workflow"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"\"Requirement → private draft → semantic batches → live user previews → deterministic structure/layou"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"t/quality validation → exact-PNG-integrity atomic publish\" — one complete loop inside DSH."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Install into DSH"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"DSH is a separate package. Install it once if you do not already have it:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Then add the plugin to a profile and start the web app:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The plugin is still on a prerelease line. Releases use the npm `latest` tag; install from `latest` t"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"o receive the current version. The older `next` tag is not the active release channel."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"For local development, build the checkout, link its absolute path into the Web profile, and then res"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" development, build the checkout, link its absolute path into the Web profile, and then restart DSH:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The `link:` dependency exposes subsequent rebuilds from this checkout, but DSH must be fully restart"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ed after replacing the profile dependency because the shipped Web profile does not hot-reload host b"},{"id":"p34s3","text":" the profile dependency because the shipped Web profile does not hot-reload host bundles by default."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Prefer not to install DSH globally? Run the same two steps through `pnpm dlx`:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"> The OpenPencil plugin is public and requires no npm token. If the DSH prerelease itself requires r"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"egistry authentication, keep that credential in a user-level or temporary npm config outside the che"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"ckout. This repository intentionally contains no registry credentials."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Design Tools"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Optional style selection uses `openpencil_style_plan` → `openpencil_style_confirm` → `openpencil_pip"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"eline_begin` with the original brief and `style_selection` handle. Catalog browsing and exact-guide "},{"id":"p39s3","text":"choice work without a model recommendation; the recommendation provider is off by default. This hand"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"off supports the script engine. App-agent and commerce handoffs remain unsupported; ordinary app-age"},{"id":"p39s5","text":"nt generation still works."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Tool | What it does |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| `openpencil_new` | Compatible fast path for simple jobs: runs one transactional QuickJS `batch_des"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"ign` script, publishes with create-if-absent semantics, and returns an editable presentation. Prefer"},{"id":"p41s3","text":" the full pipeline below for production design. |\n| `openpencil_pipeline_begin` | Starts an owner-sc"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"oped private draft, internally seeds its only root, returns `rootNodeId`, `continuationStyle`, and t"},{"id":"p41s5","text":"he compact runtime-matched canvas/build contract, then immediately opens the same live draft in the "},{"id":"p41s6","text":"sidebar; the target `.op` remains unpublished. |\n| `openpencil_pipeline_context` | Loads one bounded"},{"id":"p41s7","text":" guideline, style, theme, or UI-kit detail that is genuinely missing from the begin contract; it is "},{"id":"p41s8","text":"not a startup-context refresh loop. |\n| `openpencil_pipeline_batch` | Runs at most two direct native"},{"id":"p41s9","text":" `I(...)`/`K(...)` generation scripts: the bounded first-visible-viewport script returned by begin's"},{"id":"p41s10","text":" `next`, then one script for every remaining region. Before exposing the second preview, an authored"},{"id":"p41s11","text":"-structure gate rejects empty category/product helpers, atomically restores the first-batch snapshot"},{"id":"p41s12","text":", and permits one corrected second script without consuming the two-script budget. Each successful t"},{"id":"p41s13","text":"ransaction attempts an exact user-facing PNG and must be followed immediately, without narration, by"},{"id":"p41s14","text":" its returned `next`. A third generation script is rejected; only the complete repair gate returned "},{"id":"p41s15","text":"by finish may authorize one bounded `U(...)` QuickJS repair script. |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
